one __sync builtin (ldaddal, ldsetal, swpal, casal at 4, 8 and 1 bytes,
ldclral of a negated operand, stadd of a global, and a casal retry loop whose
compare-exchange must stay inside the loop; before, the conditional store moved
out of the loop). Option llscfold folds the ldaxr/stlxr retry loops of the same
source built without LSE (prefix x_) into the same builtins; its compare-exchange
loops stay loops, and llscfold off keeps the monitor calls.

